// Cloudflare Workers Builds runs `npx wrangler deploy` from the REPO ROOT,
// and the Worker's config lives with the app it deploys, in apps/web. This is
// Wrangler's own redirect (`.wrangler/deploy/config.json`, found by searching
// up from the working directory): `wrangler deploy` at the root reads the
// config named here, and every path inside it still resolves from apps/web.
// One config, not a root copy that has to be kept in step with it.
{ "configPath": "../../apps/web/wrangler.jsonc" }
